OL,3,GNEWSA'Men like me need law on sanitary
OL,4,Abins in toilets'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man with ulcerative colitis has
OL,7,Fbacked a campaign to make sanitary bins
OL,8,Fa legal requirement in men's toilets,
OL,9,Fsaying it is important to talk about
OL,10,Fbladder and bowel issues more openly.
OL,12,FStefan Thomas, from Witney,
OL,13,FOxfordshire, was diagnosed with the
OL,14,Fcondition when he was 27. Although
OL,15,Ftreatment has helped him "to live a
OL,16,Freasonably normal life", he still plans
OL,17,Fjourneys around access to toilets.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
