OL,3,GNEWSA'Men like me need law on sanitary
OL,4,Abins in toilets'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Boys Need Bins campaign, launched
OL,7,Fin 2023, aims to ensure men who use
OL,8,Fstoma bags, incontinence pads or other
OL,9,Fcontinence products have somewhere
OL,10,Fhygienic to dispose of waste.
OL,12,FThe government has not committed to
OL,13,Fchanging the law but said it recognised
OL,14,Fthe importance of access to appropriate
OL,15,Ffacilities.
